balance is required. It's easy to get from AC10 to AC1 and is probably worth
doing so in the early game. But dropping from 1 to -9 or -10 will suck up a
lot of time and money. And for it to be cost effective it'll require you to
keep your XPs down.

So if you get to naked AC1 and level level up, you'll have both low AC and
XPs and HPs in order to contend. 

Also lack of XPs keeps you from gaining slots for weapons, spells, and skills.

Balance is the key. 

